#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "If I<wc> is a wide character, the B<towctrans>()  function translates it "
#| "according to the transliteration descriptor I<desc>.  If I<wc> is "
#| "B<WEOF>, B<WEOF> is returned."
msgid ""
"If I<wc> is a wide character, then the B<towctrans>()  function translates "
"it according to the transliteration descriptor I<desc>.  If I<wc> is "
"B<WEOF>, B<WEOF> is returned."
msgstr ""
"Если аргумент I<wc> — это широкий символ, то функция B<towctrans> "
"транслирует его в соответствии с описателем I<desc>. Если I<wc> равно "
"B<WEOF>, то возвращается B<WEOF>."

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"I<desc> must be a transliteration descriptor returned by the B<wctrans>(3)  "
"function."
msgstr ""
"Значение I<desc> должно быть описателем транслитерации, возвращаемым "
"функцией B<wctrans>(3)."

#. type: SH
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "RETURN VALUE"
msgstr "ВОЗВРАЩАЕМОЕ ЗНАЧЕНИЕ"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"The B<towctrans>()  function returns the translated wide character, or "
"B<WEOF> if I<wc> is B<WEOF>."
msgstr ""
"Функция B<towctrans>() возвращает преобразованный широкий символ или "
"B<WEOF>, если I<wc> равно B<WEOF>."

